  </div>
  
  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Input.InputContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Defines the different input contexts for the game</p>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

  <div class="codewrapper">
    <pre><code class="lang-csharp hljs">public enum InputContext</code></pre>
  </div>
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  <h2 id="fields">Fields
  </h2>
  <dl class="parameters">
    <dt id="GameFramework_Input_InputContext_Mixed"><code>Mixed = 3</code></dt>
    
    <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Input.InputContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Both UI and Player input active (pause menu during gameplay, inventory, etc.)</p>
</dd>
    <dt id="GameFramework_Input_InputContext_None"><code>None = 0</code></dt>
    
    <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Input.InputContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">No input handling (except console)</p>
</dd>
    <dt id="GameFramework_Input_InputContext_Player"><code>Player = 2</code></dt>
    
    <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Input.InputContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Player input only (gameplay)</p>
</dd>
    <dt id="GameFramework_Input_InputContext_UI"><code>UI = 1</code></dt>
    
    <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Input.InputContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">UI input only (menus, popups, etc.)</p>
</dd>
  </dl>
  
  
  
